# Summary

Books are lent to members under the terms of the loan table of these bylaws [[cite:obs-1be3f0a06f5535401dc8cb62ea047a78484399ef "Books are lent to members under the terms of the loan table of these bylaws."]]. A member may keep novels for twenty-one days, and this period is renewable twice [[cite:obs-7525b0ec77d5da4637ab273acc87914d058bbda9 "Novels: twenty-one days, renewable twice."]].
